{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"vendor":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.vendor }}","text_style":"uppercase"}},"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Erforderliche Gangstufe nicht erreicht","set_size":3,"set_text":"W\u00e4hle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_3BdYnz":{"type":"shopify://apps/se-wishlist-engine/blocks/Product-Page/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Beschreibung","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Noch nie hat die BBQ Saison besser gestartet. In der brandneuen O'Donnell BBQ Box findest du alles, was du f\u00fcr einen perfekten Grillabend brauchst. Alle Produkte sind brandneu und nur mit der Box erh\u00e4ltlich. Au\u00dferdem ist die Box stark limitiert, sei also schnell und hol dir die hei\u00dfeste Box des Jahres.</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Inhalt / N\u00e4hrwerte","icon":"box","content":"<p>1 x 700ml Harte Nuss \"Limited BBQ Edition\"<br/>1 x BBQ Sauce \"Curry-Bratapfel\"<br/>1 x Rauchsalz<br/>1 x Streichh\u00f6lzer<br/>Sticker<br/><br/><strong>BBQ Sauce N\u00e4hrwertangabe (je 100g)</strong><br/>Brennwert: 756kJ / 180 kcal<br/>Fett: &lt;0,5g<br/>davon ges\u00e4ttigte Fetts\u00e4uren: &lt;0,1g<br/>Kohlenhydrate: 41g<br/>davon Zucker: 38g<br/>Eiwei\u00dfgehalt: 1g<br/>Salzgehalt: 2,6g</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Rezeptvorschl\u00e4ge","icon":"fire","content":"<p>Unsere Moonshine BBQ Sauce passt zu allem was gegrillt ist, egal ob Fleisch, Vegetarisch oder Vegan.\u00a0<br/>Hier findest du auch <a href=\"https://odonnell.de/blogs/cocktails/tagged/harte-nuss\" target=\"_blank\">leckere Cocktailvorschl\u00e4ge</a> mit unserer Harten Nuss.</p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Versand","icon":"truck","content":"<ul><li><strong>DHL Priority: Lieferzeit 1-2 Werktage</strong></li></ul><p>Alle Bestellungen bis 12 Uhr werden noch am selben Tag DHL \u00fcbergeben.</p><ul><li><strong>DHL Standard: Lieferzeit 2-3 Werktage</strong></li></ul>","page":""}},"recommended_products_rg9iXK":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Empfohlene Produkte","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["moonshine-adventskalender","harte-nuss-cream"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"delivery_badge_default":{"type":"delivery_badge","settings":{"delivery_text":"Delivery 1-2"}}},"block_order":["vendor","title","caption","price","delivery_badge_default","variant_picker","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_3BdYnz","description","collapsible-row-0","collapsible-row-3","collapsible-row-1","collapsible-row-2","recommended_products_rg9iXK"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"medium","mobile_thumbnails":"show","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":12}},"aad13389-b9cf-4d13-9347-0c02f8f34847":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"0bf122bd-c884-4741-9b57-ac0baae4426c":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Harte Nuss Sonderedition","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17918499782924__aad13389-b9cf-4d13-9347-0c02f8f34847-16818086767e69e669-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Nat\u00fcrlich darf ein leckerer Schluck von unserer Harten Nuss bei einem Grillabend nicht fehlen. Daf\u00fcr haben wir f\u00fcr die BBQ Box extra eine \"Limited BBQ Edition\" kreiert. </p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["0bf122bd-c884-4741-9b57-ac0baae4426c","template--17918499782924__aad13389-b9cf-4d13-9347-0c02f8f34847-16818086767e69e669-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify://shop_images/BBQBox_Motiv04_2_HN.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"79a4a449-dc8e-4d3c-84d6-48c90e6c1ba3":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"22f06935-f26e-4ca5-aafe-1f525f5694a4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Curry-Bratapfel Sauce","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17918499782924__79a4a449-dc8e-4d3c-84d6-48c90e6c1ba3-16818086767e69e669-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Schon unsere letzte BBQ Sauce ist sehr gut bei euch angekommen. Mit unserer neuen Variante, haben wir unseren Bratapfel mit feinstem indischen Curry vereint und somit ist eine schmackhafte Curry Sauce entstanden. Eine Schande wenn du dir diese beim n\u00e4chsten Grillen entgehen l\u00e4sst.</p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["22f06935-f26e-4ca5-aafe-1f525f5694a4","template--17918499782924__79a4a449-dc8e-4d3c-84d6-48c90e6c1ba3-16818086767e69e669-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify://shop_images/BBQBox_Motiv05_2_Sauce_1x1_a499485d-ae6c-4d03-96e6-4f8a8261d973.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"ac887bee-8e82-4d19-8681-c03ad847ab49":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"2ca3b2c4-0e6d-4944-8547-43297fbe3020":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"O'Donnell Rauchsalz","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17918499782924__ac887bee-8e82-4d19-8681-c03ad847ab49-16818086767e69e669-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Egal ob du damit ein deftiges Steak salzt, oder es f\u00fcr leckeres Grillgem\u00fcse nutzt - unser Rauchsalz passt immer und setzt hierbei nochmal neue geschmackliche Standards.</p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["2ca3b2c4-0e6d-4944-8547-43297fbe3020","template--17918499782924__ac887bee-8e82-4d19-8681-c03ad847ab49-16818086767e69e669-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify://shop_images/BBQBox_Motiv06_2_Salz_1x1_c6e71f41-eda3-4085-b64d-3d73e9ec0344.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"fce67d39-28b8-44e1-8e7c-146db63ef8f9":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"ec4cb992-780b-4b0f-a853-303f38336a68":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Streichh\u00f6lzer & Sticker","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17918499782924__fce67d39-28b8-44e1-8e7c-146db63ef8f9-16818086767e69e669-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Ein richtiger Moonshiner zeigt, dass er ein Moonshiner ist. Mit unserem exklusiven Sticker machst du es f\u00fcr jeden ersichtlich! Au\u00dferdem enz\u00fcndet ein Moonshiner seinen Grill ganz klassisch mit Streichh\u00f6lzern, die wir dir\u00a0mit in die Box packen. Nat\u00fcrlich im O'Donnell Design.</p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["ec4cb992-780b-4b0f-a853-303f38336a68","template--17918499782924__fce67d39-28b8-44e1-8e7c-146db63ef8f9-168